even today so i guess the key  question in the end is  am i an orientalist then i guess that  really all depends on how you define the  word orientalism  if by orientalist you mean a person a  let's say a european person who studies  the cultures of the middle east or  africa  then i guess indeed i am an orientalist  even though i wouldn't choose to call  myself one for obvious reasons  but if we define the term more narrowly  as a person who espouses  problematic perspectives on middle  eastern  or african cultures someone who  contributes to colonialist narratives of  east and west and of western superiority  or whatever  or generally just inaccurate depictions  of the middle east based on um  orientalist perspectives  that's really not for me to say i'd like  to think that i try to be  in life and in these videos and in my  academic career  and indeed i am kind of trained to be  the kind of educator who  takes a critical stance towards these  kind of probably problematic aspects of  orientalism  and instead presents these topics in a  way that is  appreciative and nuanced and inclusive  but at the end of the day it really  isn't for me to say but rather for other  people  like for example you and the audience to  determine how good of a job i am doing  at that  i hope that you found this video  somewhat informative and that it gave  you at least a couple of things to  think about as always i appreciate  all of your support for liking for  subscribing for leaving comments  as always a special shout out to all of  my patrons  and even more special shout out to the  new saints subtag addis noshikonte  and to a lead for the very generous  donation  if anna wants to become a patron and  support this channel monetarily i will  leave a link to all of that stuff  in the description but really all of  your support  liking video commenting and subscribing  all that is  immensely appreciated um and i i  wouldn't be able to do any of this  without uh  all of you guys so thank you so much and  uh i will see you next time  [Music]
 

